<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>New Lead Captured</title>
</head>
<body style="margin:0; padding:0; background:#ffffff; font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;">
  <div style="max-width:480px; margin:0 auto; padding:0 24px 40px;">

    <img src="{{emailBannerUrl}}" alt="FormaChat" width="480" style="width:100%; max-width:480px; display:block; margin:32px auto 28px; border:0;">

    <p style="font-size:15px; line-height:1.65; color:#333333; margin:0 0 20px;">
      Someone just reached out! Your AI captured a new lead on <strong>{{businessName}}</strong>. Here's what was captured:
    </p>

    <p style="font-size:15px; line-height:1.9; color:#333333; margin:0 0 24px;">
      Name: <strong>{{leadName}}</strong><br>
      {{#if leadEmail}}Email: <a href="mailto:{{leadEmail}}" style="color:#636b2f;">{{leadEmail}}</a><br>{{/if}}
      {{#if leadPhone}}Phone: {{leadPhone}}<br>{{/if}}
      Messages exchanged: {{messageCount}}<br>
      Captured: {{capturedAt}}
    </p>

    <p style="text-align:center; margin:0 0 28px;">
      <a href="https://formachat.com/#/dashboard" style="display:inline-block; padding:13px 30px; background:#636b2f; color:#ffffff; text-decoration:none; border-radius:6px; font-weight:600; font-size:15px;">View Lead in Dashboard</a>
    </p>

    <p style="font-size:13px; line-height:1.6; color:#999999; text-align:center; margin:0;">
      This lead was automatically captured by your FormaChat AI agent.<br>
      Reply promptly - leads convert best within the first hour.
    </p>

    <hr style="border:none; border-top:1px solid #636b2f; opacity:0.25; margin:32px 0 20px;">

    <p style="font-size:12px; line-height:1.6; color:#999999; margin:0;">
      &copy; {{currentYear}} FormaChat. All rights reserved.<br>
      Questions? <a href="mailto:support@formachat.com" style="color:#636b2f;">support@formachat.com</a>
    </p>

  </div>
</body>
</html>
